      "accepted_disposition_source": "Extend the abort-continuity contract to all product DMA seams: no longjmp/poll inside a submitted transport; a queued break is delivered exactly once at the first safe evaluator boundary. Add cutpoint fixtures before submit, during convergence and after proof.",
